      "type": "description",
      "text": "It is the end of the month. The cabinet gathers for the regular review of citizens' petitions. Thousands of letters arrive at the Palace every week. Vyktor has sorted them into the three most pressing demands of the moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "character": "vyktor_reznik",
      "text": "Chancellor, the people are demanding to be heard. We have three major petitions that require your immediate attention. We only have the budget and manpower to address one of them this month. Choose wisely."
    }
